    {
      "name": "Forbidden Creation - Isomer 75 / Type II",
      "unlock": "Elemental Burst",
      "description": "Sucrose hurls an unstable concoction that creates a Large Wind Spirit. While it persists, the Large Wind Spirit will continuously pull and launch nearby enemies, dealing AoE Anemo DMG.\nElemental Absorption\nIf the Wind Spirit comes into contact with Hydro / Pyro / Cryo / Electro elements, it will deal additional DMG of that type.\n\nElemental Absorption may only occur once per use.",
